{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Microjam </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">is a cute, casual collection of microgames that features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009430/extras/e696f5231603c92a2dea7ae8c9a1c222.avif?t=1768285346\" alt=\"Micro Games\" width=1560 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">50 microgames spread across 5 packs of 10 games each!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Simple inputs, mouse only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009430/extras/2b366829fa2adcb10493fc6318c6c147.avif?t=1768285346\" alt=\"Game Modes\" width=1560 height=116 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Micropacks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Bundles of 10 microgames, no lives, no pressure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Beating a micropack without losing unlocks plus mode, with an added layer of challenge, new distractions unique to each pack and limited lives.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Endless Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In endless mode, all of the games you unlocked get combined into a single fast paced experience. The better you play, the faster and more difficult the games get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">3 Different settings that can be combined to play however you want!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Practice Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play singular microgames as many times as you need to figure them out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009430/extras/0670a94cf1b1d3098ef505a6b3c97f1d.avif?t=1768285346\" alt=\"Collectables\" width=1560 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">3 different types of collectibles that appear when beating tough microgames, interacting with nanogames in endless mode, or even finding secrets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009430/extras/12e20979a25a8940b86e21c07d2dba0d.avif?t=1768285346\" alt=\"Casual Progression\" width=1560 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Micropacks can be unlocked through achieving certain goals ingame, such as beating many microgames  in infinite mode, or getting 5 stars on a micropack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every game from the Micropacks you unlocked will appear in endless mode</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Basics","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4009430/b1332b21baafe94570a936f03c733df7de2f3eb3.jpg"},{"name":"Take a picture","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4009430/79de7522915292e25e0c7a626dc5cf9878440fec.jpg"},{"name":"Spooky Season","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4009430/0492551f7ce7e7c1961ce052e38dff76d27ad2a0.jpg"},{"name":"Speed Dating","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4009430/a767790f9c9ba1577d4a97c99b91a07989105c39.jpg"},{"name":"It's been a while","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4009430/